WEBVTT

00:00:22.397 --> 00:00:25.234
The day of the Tokyo Bay
Music Fest is fast approaching!

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:27.653
The world's top artists will
be gathering in Tokyo!

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:30.822
Tickets are on sale and going
fast at your local Playland!

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:33.742
I understand your point.

00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:37.412
Then, you'll perform for us?

00:00:37.955 --> 00:00:39.957
Of course. However...

00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:44.878
I believe I'll need you to agree
to a number of conditions.

00:00:48.215 --> 00:00:49.341
...Very well.

00:00:50.342 --> 00:00:55.931
Tokyo Bay Music Fest cannot possibly
succeed without your Nittle Grasper.

00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:03.188
You won't regret it.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:09.361
Blind Game Again

00:01:09.486 --> 00:01:12.739
A pretty crazed doll
kanari kireteru doll

00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:19.204
Demolish the never-changing night
itsumademo kawaranai yoru o buchikowase

00:01:22.332 --> 00:01:27.838
The light searching in the rustling breeze
zawameku kaze ni meguru raito ga

00:01:28.046 --> 00:01:32.301
Makes a noise, scattering my memory
oto o tatete kioku o tobasu

00:01:32.551 --> 00:01:39.433
A temptation I really should know
kitto shiranu hazu mo nai yuuwaku

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:46.481
Don't Let Me Down

00:01:46.523 --> 00:01:50.319
I'm always just trying to please
itsumo kobiteru dake

00:01:50.569 --> 00:01:52.195
Cry For the Sun

00:01:52.237 --> 00:01:55.866
I can't see anything
nanimo rote ya shinai

00:01:56.283 --> 00:02:01.747
Who is it that cries out inside me?
jibun no naka de dare ga sakebu

00:02:02.998 --> 00:02:04.541
Blind Game Again

00:02:04.583 --> 00:02:07.836
A pretty classy doll
kanari kimeteru doll

00:02:07.878 --> 00:02:14.051
If it's a dream you can't reach, just toss it aside
todokanai yume nara isso nugisutero

00:02:14.134 --> 00:02:15.844
Drastic Game Again

00:02:15.886 --> 00:02:19.181
A pretty crazed doll
kanari kireteru doll

00:02:19.222 --> 00:02:25.520
Demolish the never-changing night
itsumademo kawaranai yoru o buchikowase

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:42.746
If only I could do it like that, but...

00:02:43.622 --> 00:02:46.583
| can't do it!

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:54.091
Is it true that you can't
come up with the lyrics?

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:58.011
And we don't have that many days
until we release the next album.

00:02:58.303 --> 00:02:59.638
This certainly is a problem.

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:01.640
No matter how hard Mr. Nakano
and Mr. Fujisaki work,

00:03:01.682 --> 00:03:03.433
without the crucial lyrics...

00:03:04.309 --> 00:03:06.228
Business communication,
business communication.

00:03:06.269 --> 00:03:07.854
This is K, your manager,

00:03:07.938 --> 00:03:10.774
calling Shuichi Shindo of
the popular band Bad Luck.

00:03:10.899 --> 00:03:13.860
Get to work immediately!
Do you hear me?!

00:03:16.154 --> 00:03:18.240
If you don't start
working in 10 seconds...

00:03:19.032 --> 00:03:21.201
...I will fire upon you
at point-blank range!

00:03:21.368 --> 00:03:21.993
Nooo!

00:03:21.993 --> 00:03:22.327
Mr. K, please put away the Magnum...
Nooo!

00:03:22.327 --> 00:03:22.869
Mr. K, please put away the Magnum...

00:03:22.869 --> 00:03:24.371
Mr. K, please put away the Magnum...
Damn it! Be quiet!

00:03:24.371 --> 00:03:24.913
Damn it! Be quiet!

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:29.793
K-K, don't get so excited.

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:31.294
It's just that I'm a little...

00:03:32.838 --> 00:03:34.297
There's no time!

00:03:34.339 --> 00:03:37.175
Come up with wonderful, breathtaking,
touching, tear-jerking lyrics!

00:03:37.217 --> 00:03:39.469
Write them now! Write them right away!
Write them right here!

00:03:40.512 --> 00:03:41.930
That's the thing, though...

00:03:42.347 --> 00:03:45.559
I've got absolutely no talent
for writing lyrics, after all.

00:03:46.435 --> 00:03:48.019
Come to think of it, even back then...

00:03:49.229 --> 00:03:51.732
Even back then, when I first met Yuki...

00:03:55.152 --> 00:03:57.154
Oh, shoot.

00:04:25.599 --> 00:04:27.642
Are you the one who wrote this?

00:04:27.934 --> 00:04:32.481
What? Uh, y-yes. It's sort of like
lyrics... Like a love song...

00:04:32.564 --> 00:04:33.982
A love song, huh?

00:04:34.232 --> 00:04:36.109
A grade school kid could write better.

00:04:36.443 --> 00:04:39.279
You trying to pick a fight,
calling this stuff a love song?

00:04:39.571 --> 00:04:40.322
What?!

00:04:41.364 --> 00:04:43.825
You've got zero talent. Just quit now.

00:04:45.952 --> 00:04:46.953
Did...

00:04:48.121 --> 00:04:48.789
Just Quit Now

00:04:48.789 --> 00:04:51.291
Did you have to be so harsh?!

00:04:51.291 --> 00:04:56.087
Just Quit Now

00:04:57.172 --> 00:04:58.507
So, you're in a slump.

00:04:58.673 --> 00:05:01.426
A slump? B-But...

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:05.555
Aren't people with talent the
only ones that get into slumps?

00:05:05.597 --> 00:05:07.432
Let go of the Magnum already.

00:05:07.474 --> 00:05:08.642
Never mind that...

00:05:09.392 --> 00:05:10.477
We have no time.

00:05:10.602 --> 00:05:13.480
It seems we have no choice but to
quickly go hit up another lyricist.

00:05:13.522 --> 00:05:15.065
We can't exactly do that.

00:05:16.441 --> 00:05:17.609
What's this?

00:05:17.651 --> 00:05:20.529
"For Bad Luck's next album,
there are heightening expectations..."

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:22.531
"...for lyrics by their
vocalist, Shuichi Shindo!"

00:05:22.572 --> 00:05:23.865
Wait... Hey, hey, hey!

00:05:23.949 --> 00:05:26.201
"'If it's a love song,
you can count on me!'"

00:05:26.284 --> 00:05:30.288
"The fans' expectations only increase at
Shuichi's confident declaration.”

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:33.708
"'I'll write great lyrics that'll
awe even Maki Murakami!'..."

00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:38.004
"...declares Shuichi, sparkling
for no reason as usual."

00:05:39.005 --> 00:05:41.633
So, you already announced it...

00:05:41.758 --> 00:05:42.843
Yes, he did.

00:05:42.884 --> 00:05:44.302
So, he did...

00:05:45.762 --> 00:05:48.223
Why'd he have to go into
a slump at a time like this?

00:05:51.184 --> 00:05:52.686
Sh-Shuichi?

00:05:53.603 --> 00:05:54.855
Are you cold?

00:05:56.815 --> 00:05:57.816
Falling snow (yuki)...

00:05:57.858 --> 00:05:59.234
Oh, Yuki!

00:05:59.985 --> 00:06:01.111
Why are you using gestures?

00:06:01.152 --> 00:06:02.696
Because he's in a slump?

00:06:02.863 --> 00:06:04.614
He IS in a slump, after all.

00:06:05.156 --> 00:06:07.409
A butterfly! A bird! No, a moth (ga)!

00:06:08.451 --> 00:06:09.870
Yuki is (yuki ga)... horns...

00:06:09.953 --> 00:06:11.204
No, cow?

00:06:11.705 --> 00:06:13.540
Grrr! As his manager... as his manager...

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:14.583
There, there, Mr. K...
Grrr! As his manager... as his manager...

00:06:14.583 --> 00:06:15.208
There, there, Mr. K...

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:16.251
Rhinoceros (sai)!

00:06:16.877 --> 00:06:17.669
How did you know?

00:06:17.711 --> 00:06:19.671
We go WAY back, so...

00:06:20.338 --> 00:06:21.506
Recently (saikin)!

00:06:21.882 --> 00:06:22.966
You're good.
You're good.

00:06:23.133 --> 00:06:23.675
Why was that "recently"?!
That was the rhinoceros' crotch!

00:06:23.675 --> 00:06:25.552
Please help me clean up the studio... Why was
that "recently"?! That was the rhinoceros' crotch!

00:06:25.552 --> 00:06:25.844
Why was that "recently"?!
That was the rhinoceros' crotch!

00:06:25.844 --> 00:06:27.679
Oh, shut up! Spring rolls!

00:06:27.721 --> 00:06:28.221
Loincloth!

00:06:28.221 --> 00:06:28.471
Maybe I should quit Bad Luck...

00:06:28.471 --> 00:06:30.140
Maybe I should quit Bad Luck...
We're getting colder and colder.

00:06:31.141 --> 00:06:32.976
Yuki's been acting cold recently!

00:06:33.018 --> 00:06:35.145
And that's the reason for your slump...

00:06:35.854 --> 00:06:36.855
Yup, yup.

00:06:44.154 --> 00:06:47.407
Not Home

00:06:55.498 --> 00:06:57.626
No one is currently home.

00:06:57.834 --> 00:06:59.169
If you have important business,

00:06:59.210 --> 00:07:02.339
please leave your name
and message after the beep.

00:07:04.257 --> 00:07:05.592
It's been a while.

00:07:05.800 --> 00:07:07.052
This is Seguchi.

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:09.304
About the matter we spoke of...

00:07:09.512 --> 00:07:10.931
...are you making progress?

00:07:33.203 --> 00:07:36.206
Has Yuki really been that cold lately?

00:07:36.581 --> 00:07:40.502
Yeah, it's sort of like he's avoiding me.

00:07:40.835 --> 00:07:42.671
Like he's ignoring me on purpose.

00:07:42.754 --> 00:07:44.089
| see...

00:07:47.676 --> 00:07:50.762
Say, you wanna go somewhere nice?

00:07:57.185 --> 00:07:59.521
Is this the "somewhere nice"?

00:07:59.604 --> 00:08:00.814
Bingo.

00:08:01.398 --> 00:08:03.400
And these shades are for disguise?

00:08:03.441 --> 00:08:04.651
Bingo.

00:08:04.901 --> 00:08:07.612
Though, it'd be bad if there
are any really weird people.

00:08:07.737 --> 00:08:08.571
Bingo.

00:08:09.531 --> 00:08:13.576
After all, Pelshana is kind of like
the starting point for Bad Luck.

00:08:13.618 --> 00:08:15.495
Well, that was a rather expository line,

00:08:15.578 --> 00:08:17.414
but I think it'll be good
to counteract your slump.

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:19.582
Hiro...

00:08:22.669 --> 00:08:23.920
What?

00:08:24.129 --> 00:08:26.798
Are you feeling grateful for
my passionate friendship?

00:08:26.881 --> 00:08:27.799
And while you're at it,

00:08:27.841 --> 00:08:30.093
in order to erase your loneliness
over the void Yuki left behind,

00:08:30.093 --> 00:08:32.262
you're thinking of turning
the friendship into love?

00:08:32.345 --> 00:08:34.472
| don't know what to do with you.

00:08:39.102 --> 00:08:41.479
Looks like there's no
live performance tonight.

00:08:44.733 --> 00:08:46.651
But, doesn't looking at the stage...

00:08:46.693 --> 00:08:49.487
...make you feel sort of fired up, Shu...

00:08:57.495 --> 00:09:00.999
Hey! You're going off into
Flashback World on your own?!

00:09:07.589 --> 00:09:10.175
We're tonight's opening act, Bad Luck!

00:09:10.467 --> 00:09:11.551
| hope you enjoy it!

00:09:18.516 --> 00:09:19.476
Yuki...

00:09:34.491 --> 00:09:38.870
What're you doing, Shuichi?!
The intro's over, you idiot!

00:09:50.465 --> 00:09:50.632
Yuki!

00:09:50.632 --> 00:09:51.674
Get a grip! Get a hold of yourself!
Yuki!

00:09:51.674 --> 00:09:52.634
Get a grip! Get a hold of yourself!
| don't wanna be without Yuki!

00:09:52.634 --> 00:09:53.426
This is reality! REALITY! Hello?!
| don't wanna be without Yuki!

00:09:53.426 --> 00:09:54.803
This is reality! REALITY! Hello?!
Stay with me! Stay with me!

00:09:54.803 --> 00:09:55.303
This is reality! REALITY! Hello?!
| don't want to be without you! I don't want that!

00:09:55.303 --> 00:09:56.554
Come back!
| don't want to be without you! I don't want that!

00:10:04.312 --> 00:10:05.772
Yuki!

00:10:06.272 --> 00:10:08.108
Please don't go!

00:10:09.234 --> 00:10:10.902
Yuki!

00:10:11.361 --> 00:10:15.365
Wait! Please wait!
Don't leave me behind!

00:10:15.448 --> 00:10:16.533
Calm down! I'll quit drinking! I won't
cheat on you! And I'll work fairly hard!

00:10:16.533 --> 00:10:17.826
If you don't, I'm gonna ravage you! I'll quit drinking!
I won't cheat on you! And I'll work fairly hard!

00:10:17.826 --> 00:10:18.243
I'll make you cry! Well, you're crying already, but... I'll
quit drinking! I won't cheat on you! And I'll work fairly hard!

00:10:18.243 --> 00:10:19.702
I'll make you cry! Well, you're crying already, but... I'll
even take out the garbage, and separate it out properly,

00:10:19.702 --> 00:10:21.246
Get a grip, Shuichil
so don't dump me!

00:10:21.454 --> 00:10:23.998
Forget about Mr. Yuki for now and look
at reality! Yuki! Yuki! Yuki! Yuki, Yuki!

00:10:24.207 --> 00:10:24.833
Hey, don't go tripping
just as I told you not to!

00:10:24.833 --> 00:10:26.251
Hey, don't go tripping just as I told
you not to! Yuki! Why are you going?!

00:10:26.251 --> 00:10:27.585
Yuki! Why are you going?!

00:10:27.794 --> 00:10:30.463
Yuki! Don't... Don't...

00:10:31.214 --> 00:10:34.175
Yuki! Please wait!

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:37.846
At least... At least one more time,
let me... let me...

00:10:38.388 --> 00:10:39.264
Yuki!

00:10:50.483 --> 00:10:51.818
It's no use.

00:10:52.235 --> 00:10:54.571
Go get the inside of your head cleaned.

00:10:59.409 --> 00:11:00.201
Thanks.

00:11:03.329 --> 00:11:04.998
Masujima
Books

00:11:04.998 --> 00:11:08.334
Masujima Books | see, so it reminded
him of Mr. Yuki, and backfired...

00:11:08.418 --> 00:11:09.002
Eiri Yuki Autograph Session

00:11:09.002 --> 00:11:10.920
Eiri Yuki Autograph Session
Oh, no, there was no helping it.

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:11.254
Eiri Yuki Autograph Session

00:11:11.254 --> 00:11:12.589
Eiri Yuki Autograph Session | thought
something like this might happen,

00:11:12.589 --> 00:11:14.382
Eiri Yuki Autograph Session so I've
been making my own arrangements as well.

00:11:14.591 --> 00:11:16.885
Yes. Since it's come to this,

00:11:16.968 --> 00:11:19.262
| figure I'll just have to
negotiate with him directly.

00:11:20.430 --> 00:11:21.806
Oh, it's Mr. Yuki!
Mr. Yuki!

00:11:21.848 --> 00:11:22.056
Ert Yuki

00:11:22.056 --> 00:11:23.391
Elre Yuki
It's the real Mr. Yuki!

00:11:23.725 --> 00:11:26.186
Oh, the honest to goodness
Mr. Yuki's autograph!

00:11:26.227 --> 00:11:27.812
I'm so happy, I'm so happy!
I'm so awesomely happy!

00:11:27.854 --> 00:11:30.565
You know what? You know what?
I have ALL the books you've written!

00:11:30.607 --> 00:11:33.610
| love you even more than roast fish
cake or boiled fish cake with cheese!

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:35.111
| just love, love, love you!

00:11:35.111 --> 00:11:37.363
And, and, I just...

00:11:56.925 --> 00:11:58.968
Okay, next person please.

00:11:59.052 --> 00:12:01.638
Mr. Yuki, that was the 28th person.

00:12:01.930 --> 00:12:04.057
You've certainly taken to
giving out a lot of fan service.

00:12:04.182 --> 00:12:05.934
It's a method I picked up recently.

00:12:06.517 --> 00:12:08.603
Nothing works better
with the persistent ones.

00:12:12.982 --> 00:12:14.692
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:12:42.470 --> 00:12:44.722
Could we make this quick, Mr. Sakano?

00:12:45.098 --> 00:12:46.474
I'm a busy man.

00:12:47.225 --> 00:12:48.726
What did you want to talk about?

00:12:48.935 --> 00:12:55.441
A-Actually, I-I-1 realize that you
are extremely busy, but you see...

00:12:55.733 --> 00:12:56.609
Actually...

00:12:56.734 --> 00:12:59.112
Hello... Oh? Mr. Sakano.

00:12:59.445 --> 00:13:01.948
M-Mr. President, w-w-what are you doing here?

00:13:03.116 --> 00:13:04.784
| have a little business with Eiri.

00:13:05.702 --> 00:13:08.037
Oh, please wait!
We still haven't discussed...

00:13:09.664 --> 00:13:13.001
| am very sorry, but would
you please go home?

00:13:13.126 --> 00:13:14.752
What? B-But, sir...

00:13:15.128 --> 00:13:17.839
| have an important matter
to discuss with Eiri.

00:13:18.131 --> 00:13:20.508
Please do not interfere. Understood?

00:13:25.805 --> 00:13:26.639
Well, then.

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:32.562
Pardon me for troubling you.

00:13:32.895 --> 00:13:34.564
So, about the matter we spoke of...

00:13:35.481 --> 00:13:36.733
Those two...

00:13:38.067 --> 00:13:40.903
Discussing something so amiably...
What could it be about?

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:47.869
What's with that look on your face?

00:13:48.578 --> 00:13:50.371
I've got something to say to you.

00:13:50.997 --> 00:13:52.957
I'm tired. Make it tomorrow.

00:13:54.250 --> 00:13:55.418
I really...

00:13:56.002 --> 00:13:57.879
| really want to talk to you.

00:13:58.087 --> 00:13:59.547
Tomorrow, I said.

00:13:59.964 --> 00:14:02.133
Yuki, why are you so...

00:14:02.508 --> 00:14:06.220
Shut up. I've got work to do now.
Don't disturb me.

00:14:08.556 --> 00:14:09.599
Yuki!

00:14:12.643 --> 00:14:14.103
Why?

00:14:14.437 --> 00:14:17.231
Why are you avoiding me, Yuki?!

00:14:17.398 --> 00:14:21.569
Answer me. Please, answer me, Yuki.
I'm begging you, Yuki.

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:23.488
Yuki!

00:14:41.381 --> 00:14:42.382
Yuki...

00:14:46.302 --> 00:14:47.220
Shuichi.

00:14:48.805 --> 00:14:51.265
You're going to catch a cold
sleeping in a place like that.

00:14:51.557 --> 00:14:54.936
Yuki, are you in a better mood now?

00:14:56.062 --> 00:14:58.731
You always look best when
you've got a smile on your face.

00:15:00.191 --> 00:15:03.277
Please, don't be so cold
towards me ever again!

00:15:03.653 --> 00:15:07.156
Don't ever... Don't ever
be cold to me again!

00:15:08.574 --> 00:15:11.077
I won't be cold to you again. I promise.

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:12.995
Yuki...

00:15:14.414 --> 00:15:16.165
I'll be gentle.

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:24.715
Yuki, you really mean it?

00:15:25.842 --> 00:15:27.885
You'll really be gentle with me?

00:15:28.719 --> 00:15:29.595
I--.

00:15:29.971 --> 00:15:32.348
Come on now, you're talking too much.

00:15:32.557 --> 00:15:35.059
I'll show you what being
really gentle is all about.

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:36.602
Yuki...

00:15:39.605 --> 00:15:40.481
Yuki...

00:15:41.232 --> 00:15:44.944
If this is... If this is a dream,
please don't let me wake from it.

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:47.989
Ah, it WAS a dream!

00:15:48.072 --> 00:15:50.533
And I've got no experience with
this sort of thing, to boot!

00:15:50.908 --> 00:15:55.037
Oh, come on. I'll gently torment you,
lots and lots.

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:57.290
Please stop!

00:15:57.331 --> 00:16:00.001
If this is... If this is also a dream,
please let me wake from it!

00:16:00.585 --> 00:16:03.921
No! You don't have to be mean
to me even in my dreams!

00:16:04.297 --> 00:16:05.256
Dream?

00:16:05.965 --> 00:16:07.258
Oh, it was a dream...

00:16:13.139 --> 00:16:15.683
Come on, this isn't some old manga...

00:16:17.018 --> 00:16:18.394
Hey, Yuki!

00:16:18.895 --> 00:16:21.105
Wait up! Let me at least talk...

00:16:21.355 --> 00:16:22.982
Let me at least talk to you!

00:16:23.149 --> 00:16:23.858
Why...

00:16:27.778 --> 00:16:31.741
Why? Why, Yuki?

00:16:33.034 --> 00:16:34.035
Yuki...

00:16:35.578 --> 00:16:36.913
I am much obliged.

00:16:37.330 --> 00:16:39.207
Now, regarding the Tokyo Bay Music Fest,

00:16:39.248 --> 00:16:41.334
which is currently a hot
topic among the youth...

00:16:41.375 --> 00:16:45.254
This group has been chosen
to represent Japan.

00:16:45.338 --> 00:16:47.924
